                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9575a498-0d3a-3518-b0cd-cae0b8881a93",
                        "entry_id": "0df0c6cf-6909-332d-92ea-e8f38fd11ff3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "langzaam en onopgemerkt"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f01b4f13-b172-4ef5-aa7c-638411461a1a",
                                "sense_id": "9575a498-0d3a-3518-b0cd-cae0b8881a93",
                                "text": "Bijna sluipend is de olie duurder geworden. In juni werd nog 40 dollar voor een vat olie betaald, inmiddels is dat al meer dan 60 dollar. Nog steeds ver verwijderd van de 100 dollar die een paar jaar geleden werd betaald, maar toch een prijsverhoging van 50 procent in een paar maanden tijd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a3901f63-02d6-4383-97bf-f5530bcdf0c4",
                                "sense_id": "9575a498-0d3a-3518-b0cd-cae0b8881a93",
                                "text": "Het gevaarlijkst wordt dat met de monetaire samenwerking. ,,Dat gaat sluipend. Als er eenmaal een Europese minister van Financiën is, en een Europees IMF, dan heb je een krukje om op te staan, en volgen de bevoegdheden en fondsen vanzelf.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ebfff97e-aba4-4250-8190-ad67992c0f52",
                        "source_entry_id": "0df0c6cf-6909-332d-92ea-e8f38fd11ff3",
                        "source_sense_id": "9575a498-0d3a-3518-b0cd-cae0b8881a93",
                        "target_lang_word": "insidious",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "insidious",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac8a6e34-b8fb-3b17-a37d-cfb5b7031966",
                                        "entry_id": "9400b3c9-bd6a-3ebc-bc1b-c3d7ee30bd59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing harm in a stealthy, often gradual, manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "103ac300-9b65-4a9f-b81d-b6dc19f944a6",
                                                "sense_id": "ac8a6e34-b8fb-3b17-a37d-cfb5b7031966",
                                                "text": "Strong and vigorous man as he looks, Livingstone has been for years the victim of a secret and insidious disease."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5acc9235-0587-44d2-a7f8-763dca23449b",
                                                "sense_id": "ac8a6e34-b8fb-3b17-a37d-cfb5b7031966",
                                                "text": "At some point in time they may become the source of an insidious cancer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95afb5b7-9be4-42ea-8de2-ffa23ad7b649",
                                                "sense_id": "ac8a6e34-b8fb-3b17-a37d-cfb5b7031966",
                                                "text": "The nurse always must be alert to signs of slow leak or insidious infiltration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "632bc017-c432-474b-b506-943e2e5c53ec",
                                                "sense_id": "ac8a6e34-b8fb-3b17-a37d-cfb5b7031966",
                                                "text": "The impact on rural communities of rail closures was acute, but I would argue that the worst outcome it created was the long-term diminishment of suburban capacity outside London, which has had a far more insidious effect on rail usage nationally."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                        "entry_id": "9400b3c9-bd6a-3ebc-bc1b-c3d7ee30bd59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intending to entrap; alluring but harmful."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c914ff4f-d07a-48d7-a0b4-532db6b6a331",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "Hansel and Gretel were lured by the witch’s insidious gingerbread house."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00bb5291-a8b6-491c-baa3-68b7dc40c2c6",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "Gashford slid his cold insidious palm into his master's grasp, and so, hand in hand, and followed still by Barnaby and by his mother too, they mingled with the concourse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10cce557-5c0b-4eeb-b033-5df811644974",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "The insidious whispers of the bad angel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79e9d624-5a18-4180-aa76-a69793a7c04d",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "All these facts clearly appear to me now to establish that the sanctioned scheme was a part of a bigger and […] more insidious scheme which was to hoodwink the creditors and to firmly establish and consolidate the position […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60129904-1234-4001-9943-668cddcc5fdf",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "The atmosphere of this insidious city comes out to meet him the moment he touches the European shore; for in London he meets Maria Gostrey just over from France."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6e2e19a-99e8-469a-ae7b-a6ada5480229",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "They all sought the President's views on the world situation in general and the Asian situation in particular. Without mincing words he would comment on his favorite theme, namely, the insidious scheme of the international Communists to conquer the free world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0fd8872-0009-4923-84a8-41d32f8eafe5",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "This seemed to her the worst defilement into which this insidious city had cheated her and in her agitation, she nearly ran into the latrine, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "825b8c57-c70b-4f38-9498-c8ca29cf6b1e",
                                                "sense_id": "327aa400-4d78-3843-b9ce-d434861bc278",
                                                "text": "This is the insidious way sports entrap you: you follow a player, which commits you to his team. You begin to acquire scraps of utterly useless information about teammates, managers, owners, trainers, agents, lawyers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f6704ce9-6745-36a5-8a4a-f3f976957f6b",
                                        "entry_id": "9400b3c9-bd6a-3ebc-bc1b-c3d7ee30bd59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Treacherous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "nonstandard"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6fa9abb-1d30-4b6c-b7a1-940bc91218b3",
                                                "sense_id": "f6704ce9-6745-36a5-8a4a-f3f976957f6b",
                                                "text": "The battle was lost due to the actions of insidious defectors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a70f4ab7-771b-44f1-be92-c522d4faa77a",
                                                "sense_id": "f6704ce9-6745-36a5-8a4a-f3f976957f6b",
                                                "text": "But with whom do you contract that alliance? With the natural enemy of France — that insidious house of Austria — which detests our country from feeling, system, and necessity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d68fba9-e4d6-4323-a80e-1b44c39d8343",
                                                "sense_id": "f6704ce9-6745-36a5-8a4a-f3f976957f6b",
                                                "text": "‘Believe me,’ he shouted, ‘these insidious folk talk dangerous nonsense. I hear they are spouting out their ridiculous platitudes not five miles from this park in which we are standing…’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
